<title>SWEDEN: Sweden 12 bln SKR T-bills auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Sweden 12 bln SKR T-bills auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Wednesday said an auction of T-bills of three different maturities worth 12 billion crowns was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The office said the average accepted rate in an auction of three-month Treasury bills was 3.78 percent.</p>
<p>It had invited bids for a total of two billion crowns and received 26 bids worth 10.2 billion crowns, of which it accepted two bids.</p>
</text>
